# ChangeLog file for monetdb-java
# This file is updated with Maddlog

* Thu Oct 15 2026 Joeri van Ruth joeri.van.ruth@monetdbsolutions.com
- The 'debug' and 'logfile' connect options are now ignored. The related
  fields and methods of class MapiSocket have been removed.

* Thu Oct 15 2026 Martin van Dinther <martin.van.dinther@monetdbsolutions.com>
- Corrected method DatabaseMetaData.getFunctionColumns() for result column
  COLUMN_TYPE. For functions that return a table, the returned output
  columns now return DatabaseMetaData.functionColumnResult as COLUMN_TYPE.

* Wed Sep 16 2026 Joeri van Ruth <joeri.van.ruth@monetdbsolutions.com>
- switched build system to use Maven
- The groupId in the Maven coordinates has changed from 'monetdb' to
  'org.monetdb'.

* Thu Jan  8 2026 Joeri van Ruth <joeri.van.ruth@monetdbsolutions.com>
- Compiled and released new jar files: monetdb-jdbc-12.2.jre8.jar and
  jdbcclient.jre8.jar

* Fri Jan  2 2026 Joeri van Ruth <joeri.van.ruth@monetdbsolutions.com>
- Fix backslash issues in ResultSetMetaData column names. (#11).

For a complete list of changes in previous monetdb-java releases see:
  https://www.monetdb.org/downloads/Java/archive/ChangeLog-Archive

